From b6225700b70f0314ab9fb3ef9bac0ddd5cd9b177 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ken5998 <46025606+Ken5998@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:59:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] fix(memory): give freed heap memory back by default

MM3 frees with NtFreeVirtualMemory what it allocates for each race. Without
RECOMP_HEAP_RECLAIM none of it returned, the heap spread over the physical
pages the contiguous window needs, and the second race ran out of room for
its vertex buffers and textures. RECOMP_HEAP_RECLAIM=0 turns it off.
---
 src/main.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/main.c b/src/main.c
index 5cd11f8..3d17a49 100644
--- a/src/main.c
+++ b/src/main.c
@@ -210,6 +210,13 @@ int main(void)
         return 1;
     }
 
+    /* MM3 releases with NtFreeVirtualMemory what it took for each race. Without
+     * heap reclaim none of it came back, the heap spread over the physical pages
+     * the contiguous window needs, and the second race found no room for its
+     * vertex buffers and textures. RECOMP_HEAP_RECLAIM=0 turns it off. */
+    if (!getenv("RECOMP_HEAP_RECLAIM"))
+        _putenv_s("RECOMP_HEAP_RECLAIM", "1");
+
     /* Keep the emulated RAM at 64 MB, but leave virtual address space above
      * it for MM3's large MEM_RESERVE requests. */
     xbox_SetMapSize(MM3_MEMORY_MAP_SIZE);
